  "status_text": "Tonight's floors with NOT gates all point at one open bet: how much can a NOT gate ever save? On one-a-side n by n inputs, n from 3, whether every fan-in-two AND/OR/NOT circuit of s gates gives an AND/OR one of at most s + 2n - 5 gates is on the desk as a pair of opposite conjectures, one for each answer [L-meta-19158, L-meta-19159]. On one family, checked today: at most 4 gates with NOT gates [L-meta-20572] and at least 2n - 1 without [L-meta-20573], a gap of 2n - 5.",
